---

NetMog installs nothing else, but it talks to the Npcap driver (or WinPcap),
which is a separate product with its own license. See https://npcap.com/oem/
for Npcap's redistribution terms. Npcap is not included with NetMog.

NetMog manipulates ARP on the local network. Using it against network traffic
you are not authorized to intercept or disrupt may be illegal where you live.
The license above grants rights to the software; it does not grant permission
to use it on somebody else's network.
